OL,12,G0350FWitness History
OL,13,     GIn 1981 the iconic painting,
OL,14,     GGuernica, was finally handed to
OL,15,     GSpain after a 44-year exile.
OL,16,     GPablo Picasso created the artwork
OL,17,     Gafter the town was bombed in the
OL,18,     GSpanish civil war.
